# Company Profile — HelioForge Systems

HelioForge Systems builds high-density compute hardware programs for cloud, media, industrial, networking, and storage customers. The company coordinates scarce build inputs and factory capacity across multiple customer commitments rather than owning upstream fabrication assets.

Commercial commitments differ by program. Some customers can accept region-flexible accelerated delivery, while others require fixed configurations and later ship windows. Operations reviews constrained build capacity weekly and may reallocate scarce capacity when margin uplift exceeds contractual penalties.


Product catalog:
- High-Density Compute Sled — accelerated compute hardware for large cloud deployments.
- Rendering Accelerator Module — media-rendering hardware for studio and streaming workloads.
- Edge Inference Appliance Board — rugged field-deployed inference hardware.
- CPU Analytics Server Board — general-purpose analytics compute board.
- Network Interface Card — high-throughput datacenter network adapter.
- Storage Offload Accelerator — storage-processing card for archive systems.

